No WFE on a Gunyah vCPU: Gunyah runs WFE in the guest, and vCPUs waiting in it kept their physical cores until the host's
watchdog rebooted the phone (2026-10-25). The iPadOS 17 patch, plus xnu-12377's new WFE sites (the two watchdog spins in
locore.s, the MTE variant of _copyin_atomic32_wait_if_equals, the stackshot wait loop), and WFI rather than sheng's WFE in the
proximate-timer idle path.

